program	errors/coro_group_spawn_suspending_recursion.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	suspending recursion is not allowed: the suspending-call cycle `recurse -> recurse` has no compile-time frame size (design 44 embeds callee frames by value). Break the cycle or drive the inner call separately. This refusal is PENDING SL-322, the heap-allocated-frame design: an existential dispatch of a suspending body and suspending recursion both need a heap frame with an indirect resume, so the two land together and neither alone.
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: suspending recursion is not allowed: the suspending-call cycle `recurse -> recurse` has no compile-time frame size (design 44 embeds callee frames by value). Break the cycle or drive the inner call separately. This refusal is PENDING SL-322, the heap-allocated-frame design: an existential dispatch of a suspending body and suspending recursion both need a heap frame with an indirect resume, so the two land together and neither alone."
log	"  --> examples/errors/coro_group_spawn_suspending_recursion.saw:15:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 | func recurse(n: Int) -> Int {"
log	"     | ^"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
